= The Unions Turn Away

Our policies have deeply offended the labour movement. The DGB announces that it will no longer recommend any party, and some union officials are seen at events of the Linke and the BSW. In some works councils, AfD-linked lists are gaining ground.

Most union members still vote for us, but the bond is weaker than ever. [? if sapd_formed : Some are drifting to the Soziale Linke. ?] The AfA's influence in our party has greatly diminished.
